{"version":1,"content":"<html><body><img alt=\"\" decoding=\"async\" loading=\"lazy\" src=\"https://pro-img-cdn.tvb.com/uploads/image/2026/10/202687iKHxwUXi1793055137.jpg?x-oss-process=image/resize,w_1200\"/><p>Facebook母公司Meta計劃籌集950億美元，以支持投資AI基建及超級智能業務。</p><p></p><p>當中350億美元將透過發行225億美元A類普通股，以及約125億美元優先股籌集。另外600億美元會透過ATM增發機制、即按市場價格增發股票籌集。</p><p></p><p>集資計劃有助補充公司資金來源進一步分散融資來源。輝達、AMD及博通已各自表明，合共購買最多50億美元A類普通股。</p></body></html>","scraped_at":"2026-10-26T23:40:55.428651+00:00","quality":{"score":1,"chars":173,"images":1,"source":"TVB 新聞","fallback":"none","origin":"article-html","completeness":"extracted"},"published_at":"2026-10-26T22:46:00+00:00","fetched_at":"2026-10-27T13:18:20.556995+00:00","content_updated_at":"2026-10-26T23:38:36.634889+00:00","content_hash":"2032ca6db1b5d3aae4929ddf23e49fbb61cedfd05863d8a9ff7284579223c980","evidence_status":"full","scrape_error":null,"content_retention":{"scraped_at":"2026-10-26T23:40:55.428651+00:00","latest_fallback":"rss-budget","latest_error":null},"content_capture":null}